<title>USA: Advanced NMR says to buy Advanced Mammography.</title>
<headline>Advanced NMR says to buy Advanced Mammography.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Mass. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced NMR Systems Inc said Tuesday it plans to buy Advanced Mammography Systems Inc for about $7.2 million in stock, valued at $2.50 after a proposed one for ten reverse stock split.</p>
<p>Advanced Mammography Systems' shareholders would own about forty percent of the outstanding shares of the new company.</p>
<p>The new entity will be given a new corporate name.</p>
</text>
